    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/69038778-1b01-4b17-896e-c0f6c026b640.png\" style=\"width:1.40625in;height:1.20833in\" /><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is tower and&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is house<br />Given,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></math> meters<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> meters<br />In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>OA</mi><mi>OB</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>OB</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></math> meters<br />In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>AD</mi><mi>DC</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mn>80</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>80</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> meters</p>",
